        {
          "move": "fade",
          "why": "chalk drawn and wiped reads naturally as things fading in and out, like a hand writing and erasing"
        },
        {
          "move": "stay",
          "why": "a board a teacher writes on keeps what is written where it is, so the eye can return to it"
